)` \u2192 API endpoint\\n- Removed Firebase-specific logic\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udd04 Still Need to Fix\\n\\n### Services (2 files)\\n1. **`src/services/projectService.ts`**\\n   - Replace `adminDb.collection()` with PostgreSQL queries\\n   - Use Drizzle ORM with projects table\\n   \\n2. **`src/services/transactionService.ts`**\\n   - Replace `adminDb.collection()` with PostgreSQL queries\\n   - Use Drizzle ORM with transactions table\\n   - Update pagination logic\\n\\n### API Routes (Multiple)\\n1. **User-related endpoints**\\n   - `src/app/api/users/[id]/reset-password/route.ts` - Still uses adminAuth\\n   - `src/app/api/admin/users/[id]/reset-password/route.ts` - Still uses adminAuth\\n\\n2. **Other service data endpoints**\\n   - Search for remaining `adminDb.collection()` calls\\n   - Search for remaining `adminAuth` calls\\n\\n### Hooks (Multiple)\\n1. **Data hooks still using Firebase patterns**\\n   - `src/hooks/data/use-templates.ts`\\n   - `src/hooks/data/use-docx-templates.ts`\\n   - `src/hooks/data/use-projects.ts`\\n   - `src/hooks/data/use-users.ts`\\n   - `src/hooks/data/use-sections.ts`\\n   - `src/hooks/data/use-pptx-templates.ts`\\n\\n### Components\\n1. **Login/Signup components**\\n   - `src/components/auth/LoginForm.tsx`\\n   - `src/components/auth/SignupForm.tsx`\\n   - `src/components/auth/ForgotPasswordForm.tsx`\\n   \\n2. **Other components still using Firebase auth**\\n   - Search workspace for `getAuth()`, `user.getIdToken()`, etc.\\n\\n### Context Providers\\n1. **`src/context/AuthContext.tsx`**\\n   - \u2705 Already using NextAuth (no changes needed)\\n   - Using `useSession()` correctly\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udccb Key Patterns to Follow\\n\\n### When Fixing Services\\n```typescript\\n// \u274c OLD - Firebase Firestore\\nconst userDoc = await adminDb.collection('users').doc(id).get();\\n\\n// \u2705 NEW - PostgreSQL + Drizzle\\nconst result = await db.select().from(users).where(eq(users.id, id));\\n```\\n\\n### When Fixing Hooks\\