2026-01-26 04:25:28.801 | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "create_file", "args": "{\"file_path\": \"REMAINING_AUTH_WORK_DETAILED.md\", \"initial_content\": \"# Remaining Authentication Migration Work - Detailed Plan\\n\\n**Total Files to Fix**: 11  \\n**Estimated Effort**: 3-4 hours  \\n**Priority Order**: Critical \u2192 High \u2192 Medium\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udea8 CRITICAL PRIORITY (Must fix first - 3 files)\\n\\n### 1. `src/services/projectService.ts`\\n**Status**: \u274c Still using Firebase  \\n**Lines to change**: ~150 lines  \\n**Complexity**: HIGH\\n\\n**Current Firebase Usage**:\\n```typescript\\nconst collection = adminDb.collection('projects');\\nconst snapshot = await adminDb.collection('projects')...\\nconst doc = await adminDb.collection('projects').doc(projectId).get();\\n```\\n\\n**Required Changes**:\\n- Replace all `adminDb.collection('projects')` with PostgreSQL queries\\n- Use Drizzle ORM with `projects` table\\n- Update pagination logic (`.startAfter()` \u2192 `gt()` with ID)\\n- Convert Firestore queries to SQL equivalents\\n\\n**Key Functions to Migrate**:\\n```\\n- getProjectsByUserId() \u2192 SELECT from projects WHERE userId\\n- getProjectById() \u2192 SELECT from projects WHERE id\\n- updateProject() \u2192 UPDATE projects SET\\n- deleteProject() \u2192 DELETE from projects\\n- getPaginatedProjects() \u2192 SELECT with ORDER BY and LIMIT\\n- createProject() \u2192 INSERT into projects\\n```\\n\\n**Template Pattern**:\\n```typescript\\n// Before\\nconst snapshot = await adminDb.collection('projects')\\n  .where('userId', '==', userId)\\n  .get();\\n\\n// After\\nconst result = await db\\n  .select()\\n  .from(projects)\\n  .where(eq(projects.userId, userId));\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. `src/services/transactionService.ts`\\n**Status**: \u274c Still using Firebase  \\n**Lines to change**: ~120 lines  \\n**Complexity**: HIGH\\n\\n**Current Firebase Usage**:\\n```typescript\\nconst transactionRef = adminDb.collection('transactions').doc();\\nlet query = adminDb.collection('transactions')...\\nconst snapshot = await adminDb.collection('transactions')...\\n```\\n\\n**Required Changes**:\\n- Replace all `adminDb.collection('transactions')` with PostgreSQL\\n- Update pagination with Drizzle ORM\\n- Convert transaction queries\\n\\n**Key Functions to Migrate**:\\n```\\n- createTransaction() \u2192 INSERT into transactions\\n- getTransactionsByUserId() \u2192 SELECT from transactions WHERE userId\\n- getPaginatedTransactions() \u2192 SELECT with pagination\\n- getTransactionById() \u2192 SELECT from transactions WHERE id\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. `src/services/generation-service.ts`\\n**Status**: \u274c Still using Firebase  \\n**Lines to change**: ~50 lines  \\n**Complexity**: MEDIUM\\n\\n**Current Firebase Usage**:\\n```typescript\\nawait adminDb.collection('agent_generations').add(generationLog);\\n```\\n\\n**Required Changes**:\\n- Replace with INSERT into `generation_history` table\\n- Update to use Drizzle ORM\\n\\n**Key Functions to Migrate**:\\n```\\n- Log generation activity \u2192 INSERT into generation_history\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udd34 HIGH PRIORITY (3 files)\\n\\n### 4. `src/app/api/users/[id]/reset-password/route.ts`\\n**Status**: \u274c Uses adminAuth  \\n**Complexity**: MEDIUM\\n\\n**Current Issues**:\\n```typescript\\n// Still references Firebase\\nconst link = await adminAuth.generatePasswordResetLink(user.email);\\n```\\n\\n**Required Changes**:\\n1. Remove Firebase password reset logic\\n2. Implement PostgreSQL-based password reset\\n3. Generate reset token/link\\n4. Update password via API\\n\\n**Implementation**:\\n```typescript\\n// 1. Get user from PostgreSQL\\n// 2. Generate reset token (random string)\\n// 3. Store token in database with expiry\\n// 4. Send email with reset link\\n// 5. Verify token when user resets password\\n// 6. Update password with bcryptjs hash\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 5. `src/app/api/admin/users/[id]/reset-password/route.ts`\\n**Status**: \u274c Uses adminAuth  \\n**Complexity**: MEDIUM\\n\\n**Same as above** - implement PostgreSQL-based password reset\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 6. `src/app/manage-users/actions.ts`\\n**Status**: \u274c Unknown Firebase usage  \\n**Complexity**: MEDIUM\\n\\n**Need to check**: Likely uses `adminAuth` or `adminDb`\\n\\n**Required Changes**: Convert to PostgreSQL queries or API calls\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udfe0 MEDIUM PRIORITY (5 files)\\n\\n### 7. `src/services/templateService.ts`\\n**Status**: \u26a0\ufe0f Partially fixed  \\n**Lines to change**: ~40 lines  \\n**Complexity**: MEDIUM\\n\\n**Current Firebase Usage**:\\n```typescript\\nconst collectionRef = adminDb.collection('templates').doc(templateType).collection('styles');\\n```\\n\\n**Required Changes**:\\n- Already using PostgreSQL for report templates\\n- Need to check if there are other template types using Firebase\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 8-11. Data Hooks & Components\\n**Files**:\\n- `src/hooks/data/use-templates.ts`\\n- `src/hooks/data/use-projects.ts`\\n- `src/hooks/data/use-users.ts`\\n- `src/components/auth/LoginForm.tsx`\\n- Plus others\\n\\n**Status**: \u26a0\ufe0f May be using old Firebase patterns  \\n**Required**: Review and update to use NextAuth + new services\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Test Files (Can update later)\\n- `src/app/api/__tests__/users.test.ts`\\n- `src/services/__tests__/generation-service.test.ts`\\n- `src/lib/db/seed.ts` (Already fixed for seeding)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udccb DETAILED IMPLEMENTATION GUIDE\\n\\n### For Services (projectService, transactionService, generation-service)\\n\\n**Step 1**: Add PostgreSQL imports\\n```typescript\\nimport { db } from '@/db';\\nimport { projects, transactions, generation_history } from '@/db/schema';\\nimport { eq, and, desc, gt } from 'drizzle-orm';\\n```\\n\\n**Step 2**: Replace collection reference with table\\n```typescript\\n// Before\\nconst collection = adminDb.collection('projects');\\n\\n// After\\n// (Use `projects` table directly with db.select/insert/update/delete)\\n```\\n\\n**Step 3**: Convert Firestore patterns to SQL\\n```typescript\\n// Firestore snapshot pattern\\nconst snapshot = await adminDb.collection('projects').get();\\nconst items = snapshot.docs.map(doc => ({ id: doc.id, ...doc.data() }));\\n\\n// SQL pattern\\nconst items = await db.select().from(projects);\\n```\\n\\n**Step 4**: Update pagination\\n```typescript\\n// Firestore pagination\\nif (lastVisibleId) {\\n  const lastDoc = await adminDb.collection('projects').doc(lastVisibleId).get();\\n  query = query.startAfter(lastDoc);\\n}\\n\\n// SQL pagination\\nconst lastId = lastVisibleId ? parseInt(lastVisibleId) : 0;\\n// Then use gt(projects.id, lastId)\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udd11 Key Conversions Reference\\n\\n### Common Patterns\\n\\n**Create (INSERT)**:\\n```typescript\\n// Before\\nawait adminDb.collection('projects').add({ title, userId });\\n\\n// After\\nconst result = await db.insert(projects).values({ title, userId }).returning();\\n```\\n\\n**Read Single (SELECT)**:\\n```typescript\\n// Before\\nconst doc = await adminDb.collection('projects').doc(id).get();\\nconst data = doc.data();\\n\\n// After\\nconst result = await db.select().from(projects).where(eq(projects.id, id));\\n```\\n\\n**Read Multiple (SELECT)**:\\n```typescript\\n// Before\\nconst snapshot = await adminDb.collection('projects').where('userId', '==', userId).get();\\n\\n// After\\nconst result = await db.select().from(projects).where(eq(projects.userId, userId));\\n```\\n\\n**Update (UPDATE)**:\\n```typescript\\n// Before\\nawait adminDb.collection('projects').doc(id).update(data);\\n\\n// After\\nawait db.update(projects).set(data).where(eq(projects.id, id));\\n```\\n\\n**Delete (DELETE)**:\\n```typescript\\n// Before\\nawait adminDb.collection('projects').doc(id).delete();\\n\\n// After\\nawait db.delete(projects).where(eq(projects.id, id));\\n```\\n\\n**Pagination (ORDER BY + LIMIT)**:\\n```typescript\\n// Before\\nquery.orderBy('createdAt', 'desc').limit(limit + 1)\\n\\n// After\\nawait db.select().from(projects)\\n  .where(gt(projects.id, lastId))\\n  .orderBy(desc(projects.createdAt))\\n  .limit(limit + 1)\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \u2705 COMPLETION CHECKLIST\\n\\n### Phase 1: Critical Services\\n- [ ] Fix `projectService.ts`\\n  - [ ] Replace all Firestore queries\\n  - [ ] Test all functions\\n  - [ ] Verify pagination\\n\\n- [ ] Fix `transactionService.ts`\\n  - [ ] Replace all Firestore queries\\n  - [ ] Test all functions\\n  - [ ] Verify pagination\\n\\n- [ ] Fix `generation-service.ts`\\n  - [ ] Replace Firestore insert\\n  - [ ] Verify logging works\\n\\n### Phase 2: API Routes\\n- [ ] Fix `/api/users/[id]/reset-password/route.ts`\\n  - [ ] Implement token-based password reset\\n  - [ ] Store tokens in database\\n  - [ ] Verify email sending\\n\\n- [ ] Fix `/api/admin/users/[id]/reset-password/route.ts`\\n  - [ ] Same as above for admin endpoint\\n\\n### Phase 3: Server Actions\\n- [ ] Fix `src/app/manage-users/actions.ts`\\n  - [ ] Replace Firebase references\\n  - [ ] Update to use new services\\n\\n### Phase 4: Templates & Others\\n- [ ] Complete `templateService.ts`\\n  - [ ] Ensure all template types use PostgreSQL\\n\\n### Phase 5: Cleanup\\n- [ ] Remove all Firebase imports\\n- [ ] Test full auth flow\\n- [ ] Verify no Firebase references remain\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83e\uddea TESTING STRATEGY\\n\\n**For each service**:\\n1. Write test for each function\\n2. Verify PostgreSQL queries work\\n3. Test error handling\\n4. Test edge cases (empty results, pagination, etc.)\\n\\n**For API routes**:\\n1. Test with valid data\\n2. Test with invalid data\\n3. Test authentication\\n4. Test error responses\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcde COMMANDS TO FIND REMAINING WORK\\n\\n```bash\\n# Find all Firebase references\\ngrep -r \\\"adminDb\\\\|adminAuth\\\\|firebase\\\" src/ --include=\\\"*.ts\\\" --include=\\\"*.tsx\\\"\\n\\n# Find Firestore patterns\\ngrep -r \\\"collection\\\\|\\\\.doc(\\\" src/services src/app/api --include=\\\"*.ts\\\"\\n\\n# Find Firebase imports\\ngrep -r \\\"from 'firebase\\\" src/ --include=\\\"*.ts\\\" --include=\\\"*.tsx\\\"\\n\\n# Check for getAuth, getIdToken patterns\\ngrep -r \\\"getAuth\\\\|getIdToken\\\" src/ --include=\\\"*.ts\\\" --include=\\\"*.tsx\\\"\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83d\udcca EFFORT ESTIMATE\\n\\n| File | Lines | Complexity | Time |\\n|------|-------|-----------|------|\\n| projectService.ts | 150 | HIGH | 60 min |\\n| transactionService.ts | 120 | HIGH | 50 min |\\n| generation-service.ts | 50 | MEDIUM | 20 min |\\n| reset-password routes | 100 | MEDIUM | 40 min |\\n| manage-users/actions.ts | 50 | MEDIUM | 20 min |\\n| Cleanup & testing | - | - | 30 min |\\n| **TOTAL** | **~470** | | **~220 min (3.5 hrs)** |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## \ud83c\udfaf SUCCESS CRITERIA\\n\\n- [ ] All `adminDb` references removed\\n- [ ] All `adminAuth` references removed\\n- [ ] All services use PostgreSQL + Drizzle\\n- [ ] All API routes use NextAuth\\n- [ ] No Firebase imports remain\\n- [ ] Full auth flow works end-to-end\\n- [ ] All tests pass\\n- [ ] Ready for production deployment\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Priority**: CRITICAL \u2192 HIGH \u2192 MEDIUM  \\n**Recommended Order**: projectService \u2192 transactionService \u2192 generation-service \u2192 API routes \u2192 cleanup\\n\\nStart with `projectService.ts` as it's most critical and will establish the pattern for others!\\n\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01SsYNtrG3ngUbkSJ6T8Aqhk", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
