b.select().from(projects).where(eq(projects.userId, uid));\\n\\n// PATTERN 3: INSERT\\nOLD:  const ref = adminDb.collection(\'projects\').doc();\\n      await ref.set({ title, userId });\\nNEW:  const result = await db.insert(projects).values({ title, userId }).returning();\\n\\n// PATTERN 4: UPDATE\\nOLD:  await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').doc(id).update({ title: newTitle });\\nNEW:  await db.update(projects).set({ title: newTitle }).where(eq(projects.id, id));\\n\\n// PATTERN 5: DELETE\\nOLD:  await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').doc(id).delete();\\nNEW:  await db.delete(projects).where(eq(projects.id, id));\\n\\n// PATTERN 6: PAGINATION\\nOLD:  .where(\'id\', \'>\', lastId).orderBy(\'createdAt\', \'desc\').limit(10+1)\\nNEW:  .where(gt(projects.id, lastId)).orderBy(desc(projects.createdAt)).limit(10+1)\\n\\n// PATTERN 7: Firestore Batch (projectService, transactionService)\\nOLD:  const batch = adminDb.batch();\\n      batch.set(ref, data);\\n      batch.update(ref2, data2);\\n      await batch.commit();\\nNEW:  // Just do multiple queries - no batch needed\\n      await db.insert(table).values(data);\\n      await db.update(table).set(data2).where(...);\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## ✅ Completion Checklist\\n\\n### Before Starting\\n- [ ] Read REMAINING_AUTH_WORK_DETAILED.md (20 min)\\n- [ ] Read REMAINING_WORK_EXECUTION_PLAN.md (15 min)\\n- [ ] Review patterns above\\n- [ ] Have PostgreSQL schema open\\n- [ ] Have dev server ready to test\\n\\n### For Each File\\n- [ ] Identify all `adminDb` references (grep)\\n- [ ] Add PostgreSQL imports\\n- [ ] Convert each function\\n- [ ] Test immediately in dev\\n- [ ] Commit changes\\n- [ ] Verify no Firebase refs remain\\n\\n### After Each Session\\n- [ ] Run full test suite\\n- [ ] Check console for errors\\n- [ ] Verify no Firebase imports remain in modified files\\n- [ ] Update progress documentation\\n\\n### Final Verification\\n- [ ] All 11 files migrated\\n- [ ] 0 Firebase references remaining\\n- [ ] All tests passing\\n- [ ] Full auth flow works\\n  - [ ] Signup\\n  - [ ] Login\\n  - [ ] Logout\\n  - [ ] Password reset\\n  - [ ] User profile\\n  - [ ] Admin functions\\n- [ ] No console warnings/errors\\n- [ ] Production ready\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🧭 Step-by-Step Quick Start\\n\\n### First 5 Minutes\\n1. Read this file completely\\n2. Open REMAINING_AUTH_WORK_DETAILED.md\\n3. Skim the patterns section\\n\\n### First 30 Minutes\\n1. Open Terminal\\n2. Run: `grep -n \\"adminDb\\\\|adminAuth\\" src/services/projectService.ts`\\n3. Open projectService.ts in editor\\n4. Review each function that needs converting\\n\\n### First Hour\\n1. Add PostgreSQL imports\\n2. Convert first function (getProjectsByUserId)\\n3. Test in dev server\\n4. Verify it works\\n\\n### Then Continue\\n1. Convert remaining functions one by one\\n2. Test after each one\\n3. Commit after each function\\n4. Move to next file\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Common Questions\\n\\n**Q: Should I do all files at once?**  \\nA: No, do one file at a time. Test after each. Easier to debug.\\n\\n**Q: Which file should I start with?**  \\nA: Start with `projectService.ts` - it\'s the pattern setter.\\n\\n**Q: Can I do these in any order?**  \\nA: Critical files first (services), then high priority, then medium.\\n\\n**Q: How do I test each function?**  \\nA: Use dev server + manual testing, or create test files.\\n\\n**Q: What if I break something?**  \\nA: Git commit after each file, can revert easily.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 Success Indicators\\n\\n**You know you\'re done when**:\\n- ✅ No `adminDb` or `adminAuth` in any modified file\\n- ✅ All tests pass\\n- ✅ Dev server runs without Firebase errors\\n- ✅ Can create projects, transactions, reset passwords\\n- ✅ Admin functions work\\n- ✅ Zero console errors\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📈 Progress Milestones\\n\\n```\\nStart: 50% (4/15 files)\\n  ↓\\nAfter Services: 75% (8/15 files) - Everything working except password reset\\n  ↓\\nAfter Routes: 90% (11/15 files) - Full auth system complete\\n  ↓\\nAfter Cleanup: 100% (15/15 files) - Production ready\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Launch Checklist\\n\\nWhen you\'re 100% done:\\n- [ ] Run: `npm run build`\\n- [ ] Run: `npm run test`\\n- [ ] Run: `npm run lint`\\n- [ ] Manual test entire auth flow\\n- [ ] Deploy to staging\\n- [ ] Deploy to production\\n- [ ] Monitor for errors\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Help & Support\\n\\n**If stuck**:\\n1. Check REMAINING_AUTH_WORK_DETAILED.md for your specific file\\n2. Review patterns above\\n3. Check git diff to see what changed\\n4. Try reverting last change and re-reading the pattern\\n\\n**Common errors**:\\n- Type mismatch (string vs number IDs) → Use `parseInt(id)`\\n- Pagination not working → Check `gt()` and `desc()` imports\\n- Firestore refs left → Search for remaining `adminDb` calls\\n- Test failures → Mock functions may need updating\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 Final Summary\\n\\n**What\'s Done**:\\n- ✅ Core authentication system (50%)\\n- ✅ Production-ready patterns\\n- ✅ User service fully migrated\\n- ✅ API service updated\\n- ✅ Auth hooks updated\\n\\n**What\'s Left**:\\n- ⚠️ 3 core services (projectService, transactionService, generation-service)\\n- ⚠️ Password reset implementation\\n- ⚠️ API routes for user management\\n- ⚠️ Cleanup and verification\\n\\n**Time to Complete**:\\n- 🕐 Realistic estimate: 3.5-4 hours\\n- 📅 Can be done in 1-3 sessions\\n- 🎯 Recommended: 3 sessions of 1.5 hours each\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🎯 Next Action\\n\\n**START HERE**: Open `REMAINING_AUTH_WORK_DETAILED.md` and begin with `src/services/projectService.ts`\\n\\n**Time Now**: Read documentation files first (30 minutes)  \\n**Then**: Start converting projectService.ts (60 minutes)  \\n**Total Session 1**: ~90 minutes to 75% completion\\n\\n**Good luck! You\'ve got this! 🚀**\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Files Created**:\\n- REMAINING_AUTH_WORK_DETAILED.md (Main reference)\\n- REMAINING_WORK_EXECUTION_PLAN.md (Execution guide)\\n- REMAINING_WORK_INDEX.md (This file - Navigation guide)\\n\\n**Status**: Ready to begin Phas