app/api/users/[id]/reset-password/route.ts`\n 105 **Status**: ❌ Uses adminAuth  \n 106 **Complexity**: MEDIUM\n 107 \n 108 **Current Issues**:\n 109 ```typescript\n 110 // Still references Firebase\n 111 const link = await adminAuth.generatePasswordResetLink(user.email);\n 112 ```\n 113 \n 114 **Required Changes**:\n 115 1. Remove Firebase password reset logic\n 116 2. Implement PostgreSQL-based password reset\n 117 3. Generate reset token/link\n 118 4. Update password via API\n 119 \n 120 **Implementation**:\n 121 ```typescript\n 122 // 1. Get user from PostgreSQL\n 123 // 2. Generate reset token (random string)\n 124 // 3. Store token in database with expiry\n 125 // 4. Send email with reset link\n 126 // 5. Verify token when user resets password\n 127 // 6. Update password with bcryptjs hash\n 128 ```\n 129 \n 130 ---\n 131 \n 132 ### 5. `src/app/api/admin/users/[id]/reset-password/route.ts`\n 133 **Status**: ❌ Uses adminAuth  \n 134 **Complexity**: MEDIUM\n 135 \n 136 **Same as above** - implement PostgreSQL-based password reset\n 137 \n 138 ---\n 139 \n 140 ### 6. `src/app/manage-users/actions.ts`\n 141 **Status**: ❌ Unknown Firebase usage  \n 142 **Complexity**: MEDIUM\n 143 \n 144 **Need to check**: Likely uses `adminAuth` or `adminDb`\n 145 \n 146 **Required Changes**: Convert to PostgreSQL queries or API calls\n 147 \n 148 ---\n 149 \n 150 ## 🟠 MEDIUM PRIORITY (5 files)\n 151 \n 152 ### 7. `src/services/templateService.ts`\n 153 **Status**: ⚠️ Partially fixed  \n 154 **Lines to change**: ~40 lines  \n 155 **Complexity**: MEDIUM\n 156 \n 157 **Current Firebase Usage**:\n 158 ```typescript\n 159 const collectionRef = adminDb.collection(\'templates\').doc(templateType).collection(\'styles\');\n 160 ```\n 161 \n 162 **Required Changes**:\n 163 - Already using PostgreSQL for report templates\n 164 - Need to check if there are other template types using Firebase\n 165 \n 166 ---\n 167 \n 168 ### 8-11. Data Hooks & Components\n 169 **Files**:\n 170 - `src/hooks/data/use-templates.ts`\n 171 - `src/hooks/data/use-projects.ts`\n 172 - `src/hooks/data/use-users.ts`\n 173 - `src/components/auth/LoginForm.tsx`\n 174 - Plus others\n 175 \n 176 **Status**: ⚠️ May be using old Firebase patterns  \n 177 **Required**: Review and update to use NextAuth + new services\n 178 \n 179 ---\n 180 \n 181 ### Test Files (Can update later)\n 182 - `src/app/api/__tests__/users.test.ts`\n 183 - `src/services/__tests__/generation-service.test.ts`\n 184 - `src/lib/db/seed.ts` (Already fixed for seeding)\n 185 \n 186 ---\n 187 \n 188 ## 📋 DETAILED IMPLEMENTATION GUIDE\n 189 \n 190 ### For Services (projectService, transactionService, generation-service)\n 191 \n 192 **Step 1**: Add PostgreSQL imports\n 193 ```typescript\n 194 import { db } from \'@/db\';\n 195 import { projects, transactions, generation_history } from \'@/db/schema\';\n 196 import { eq, and, desc, gt } from \'drizzle-orm\';\n 197 ```\n 198 \n 199 **Step 2**: Replace collection reference with table\n 200 ```typescript\n 201 // Before\n 202 const collection = adminDb.collection(\'projects\');\n 203 \n 204 // After\n 205 // (Use `projects` table directly with db.select/insert/update/delete)\n 206 ```\n 207 \n 208 **Step 3**: Convert Firestore patterns to SQL\n 209 ```typescript\n 210 // Firestore snapshot pattern\n 211 const snapshot = await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').get();\n 212 const items = snapshot.docs.map(doc => ({ id: doc.id, ...doc.data() }));\n 213 \n 214 // SQL pattern\n 215 const items = await db.select().from(projects);\n 216 ```\n 217 \n 218 **Step 4**: Update pagination\n 219 ```typescript\n 220 // Firestore pagination\n 221 if (lastVisibleId) {\n 222   const lastDoc = await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').doc(lastVisibleId).get();\n 223   query = query.startAfter(lastDoc);\n 224 }\n 225 \n 226 // SQL pagination\n 227 const lastId = lastVisibleId ? parseInt(lastVisibleId) : 0;\n 228 // Then use gt(projects.id, lastId)\n 229 ```\n 230 \n 231 ---\n 232 \n 233 ## 🔑 Key Conversions Reference\n 234 \n 235 ### Common Patterns\n 236 \n 237 **Create (INSERT)**:\n 238 ```typescript\n 239 // Before\n 240 await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').add({ title, userId });\n 241 \n 242 // After\n 243 const result = await db.insert(projects).values({ title, userId }).returning();\n 244 ```\n 245 \n 246 **Read Single (SELECT)**:\n 247 ```typescript\n 248 // Before\n 249 const doc = await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').doc(id).get();\n 250 const data = doc.data();\n 251 \n 252 // After\n 253 const result = await db.select().from(projects).where(eq(projects.id, id));\n 254 ```\n 255 \n 256 **Read Multiple (SELECT)**:\n 257 ```typescript\n 258 // Before\n 259 const snapshot = await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').where(\'userId\', \'==\', userId).get();\n 260 \n 261 // After\n 262 const result = await db.select().from(projects).where(eq(projects.userId, userId));\n 263 ```\n 264 \n 265 **Update (UPDATE)**:\n 266 ```typescript\n 267 // Before\n 268 await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').doc(id).update(data);\n 269 \n 270 // After\n 271 await db.update(projects).set(data).where(eq(projects.id, id));\n 272 ```\n 273 \n 274 **Delete (DELETE)**:\n 275 ```typescript\n 276 // Before\n 277 await adminDb.collection(\'projects\').doc(id).delete();\n 278 \n 279 // After\n 280 await db.delete(projects).where(eq(projects.id, id));\n 281 ```\n 282 \n 283 **Pagination (ORDER BY + LIMIT)**:\n 284 ```typescript\n 285 // Before\n 286 query.orderBy(\'createdAt\', \'desc\').limit(limit + 1)\n 287 \n 288 // After\n 289 await db.select().from(projects)\n 290   .where(gt(projects.id, lastId))\n 291   .orderBy(desc(projects.createdAt))\n 292   .limit(limit + 1)\n 293 ```\n 294 \n 295 ---\n 296 \n 297 ## ✅ COMPLETION CHECKLIST\n 298 \n 299 ### Phase 1: Critical Services\n 300 - [ ] Fix `projectService.ts`\n 301   - [ ] Replace all Firestore queries\n 302   - [ ] Test all functions\n 303   - [ ] Verify pagination\n 304 \n 305 - [ ] Fix `transactionService.ts`\n 306   - [