2026-01-26 18:11:48.507 | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": "{\"plan\": \"## Implementation Plan: Firebase DB Helper Functions\\n\\n### Overview\\nCreate a centralized database helper layer (`src/lib/firebase/db-helpers.ts`) that abstracts all Firestore operations, then refactor services to use these helpers for better code reusability and maintainability.\\n\\n### Architecture\\n\\n```\\nAPI Routes \u2192 Services \u2192 DB Helpers \u2192 Firestore (via adminDb)\\n```\\n\\n### Phase 1: Create DB Helper Functions\\n- **File**: `src/lib/firebase/db-helpers.ts` (~400 lines)\\n- **Contents**:\\n  - Generic Firestore helpers (get, list, create, update, delete, paginate)\\n  - Collection-specific helpers for Users, Projects, Sections, Templates, Transactions\\n  - Type-safe query builders with filtering and pagination\\n  - Transaction wrapper utilities\\n  - Batch operation support\\n\\n### Phase 2: Refactor Services\\n- Update `src/services/projectService.ts` to use db-helpers\\n- Update `src/services/userService.ts` to use db-helpers\\n- Keep service APIs unchanged (backward compatible)\\n\\n### Key Helper Categories\\n\\n**Generic Helpers:**\\n- `getDoc<T>(collection, docId)` - Get single document\\n- `listDocs<T>(collection, filters?, orderBy?, limit?)` - Query documents\\n- `createDoc<T>(collection, data)` - Create with auto-ID\\n- `updateDoc<T>(collection, docId, data)` - Merge update\\n- `deleteDoc(collection, docId)` - Delete document\\n- `paginateQuery<T>(collection, limit, startAfter?)` - Paginated results\\n\\n**Collection-Specific:**\\n- Users: `getUser`, `listUsers`, `createUser`, `updateUser`, `deleteUser`, `getUserCredits`\\n- Projects: `getProject`, `listProjectsByAuthor`, `saveProject`, `deleteProject`\\n- Sections: `getSection`, `listSectionsByProject`, `saveSection`\\n- Templates: `getTemplate`, `listTemplates`, `saveTemplate`\\n- Transactions: `getTransaction`, `listUserTransactions`, `createTransaction`\\n\\n### Benefits\\n\u2705 DRY - Eliminate repeated query patterns\\n\u2705 Maintainable - Single source of truth for DB operations\\n\u2705 Testable - Easy to mock and unit test\\n\u2705 Type-safe - Full TypeScript support\\n\u2705 Extensible - Add new collections easily\\n\u2705 Backward compatible - Existing routes continue working\"}", "tool_call_id": "toolu_bdrk_01M9wmYPiEiytyBPJHUXER4W", "id": null, "provider_details": null, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
